# ── Claude Code (claude-directory, memory, worktrees, agent-gitignore)
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/agent-memory-local/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
# empty read-only stubs that Claude Code's sandbox mounts into a working tree; a real folder of the same name stays listed
/.claude/commands
!/.claude/commands/
/.claude/output-styles
!/.claude/output-styles/
/.claude/routines
!/.claude/routines/
# the Desktop app's preview servers, local to one machine (git add -f .claude/launch.json shares one)
/.claude/launch.json

# ── other coding harnesses' local files (agent-gitignore)
AGENTS.local.md
AGENTS.override.md
.aider*

# ── a session's handoff before Claude Code compacts it (.claude/hooks/handoff.py)
docs/handoff/

# ── generated results (run state lives outside the repository, in <runs root>/)
evals/results/
plugins/*/evals/results/
graphify-out/
wiki/graph/

# ── Obsidian (the checkout is the claude-obsidian vault, wiki/ its pages): only the shared settings are committed;
# workspace*.json, the rest of .obsidian/ and the plugin's transaction journal stay local
.obsidian/*
!.obsidian/app.json
!.obsidian/appearance.json
!.obsidian/core-plugins.json
!.obsidian/graph.json
!.obsidian/snippets/
.vault-meta/transactions/

# ── secrets (never committed; also denied to Claude in settings.json)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*-service-account.json

# ── Python / uv
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# ── editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.ingest-fixture-store/

# ── the setup log of ops/bootstrap.py
.claude/bootstrap.log
.claude/bootstrap.lock
